<title>INDONESIA: Badminton-Locals take all Indonesian open titles.</title>
<headline>Badminton-Locals take all Indonesian open titles.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final results from the $175,000 1996 Sony Badminton Indonesian Open completed on Saturday night in Medan, North Sumatra.</p>
<p>(Players Indonesian unless stated)</p>
<p>Men's singles</p>
<p>Joko Suprianto bt Budi Santoso 15-8 15-4</p>
<p>Ladies singles</p>
<p>Susi Susanti bt Wang Chen (China) 11-8 11-8</p>
<p>Men's doubles</p>
<p>Antonius Irianto/Denny Kantono bt Halim Heryanto/Davis Efraim</p>
<p>15-3 15-10</p>
<p>Women's doubles</p>
<p>Elisa/Zelin Resina bt Rikke Olsen/Helen Kirkegaard</p>
<p>(Denmark) 15-7 15-4</p>
<p>Mixed doubles</p>
<p>Haryanto Trikus/Minarti Timur bt Flandy Nimpele/Rosalina Riseu 15-8 15-1</p>
</text>
